{
  "_doc": [
    "Twenty-CRM permission policy. Specific to this project — see plans/2026-05-13-claude-permissions-system.md for the design doc.",
    "Mode: acceptEdits (auto-accept Edit/Write/MultiEdit bounded by scope-edits hook; prompt on Bash not on allow list; hard-deny on the deny list).",
    "Hard-deny is for truly destructive ops only (rm -rf, sudo, auto-fixers, sensitive paths, kubectl/helm, in-place sed/awk/perl, non-curl network).",
    "Most docker/git mutations + package installs are NOT denied — they fall through to the user prompt (Section 4G of the plan) so the supervisor approves ad-hoc."
  ],
